    "invariants": [
      "Only a signed paid completed/async-success event for an attributed known credit checkout grants funding.",
      "Unpaid and async-pending sessions remain unfunded; failed/expired notifications are currently ignored, never evidence of payment.",
      "A completed checkout never regresses or grants another lot on repeated or reordered notifications.",
      "One funding lot, one immutable grant transaction, and one conversion correspond to a completed payment.",
      "Checkout creation persists the authorized account and remains unfunded."
    ],
